    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_GoingToSeeProfRowan",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What was that about?!\r",
        "Oh, hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "Hey! I’m going to see Prof. Rowan!\n",
        "You should come, too! And quickly!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_OhJeezForgotSomething",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Oh, jeez!\n",
        "Forgot something!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_RivalWasLookingForYou1",
      "en_US": [
        "Hiya, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was looking for you.\r",
        "I think he’s home now.\n",
        "Why don’t you go check it out?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_RivalWasLookingForYou2",
      "en_US": [
        "Hiya, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was looking for you.\r",
        "I think he’s home now.\n",
        "Why don’t you go check it out?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_RivalWentTearingOff",
      "en_US": [
        "Hiya, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "You’re looking for {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}?\r",
        "He just went tearing off a little\n",
        "while ago.\r",
        "He’s probably not gone too far.\n",
        "Why not go chase after him?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_RivalWentTearingOffOuch",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? He went tearing off\n",
        "in a huge rush a while ago.\r",
        "...Ouch. He ran right into me earlier.\n",
        "It’s still hurting.\f",
        "That kid’s growing up tough."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_EveryoneGoesOnAdventures",
      "en_US": [
        "Everyone goes off on adventures,\n",
        "and then they gradually grow up..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_WildPokemonAttack",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s true that wild Pokémon do attack\n",
        "people sometimes...\r",
        "But, Pokémon also open their hearts\n",
        "to you, so you can become friends."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_PokemonYouLookGoodTogether",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! A Pokémon!\n",
        "You look good together!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_HelpingPutTogetherPokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, you’re helping put together\n",
        "a Pokédex?\r",
        "That means you’re going to travel\n",
        "all over the place with Pokémon!\r",
        "That sounds like a lot of fun!\n",
        "I’m a little envious, to be honest!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_TechnologyBlowsMeAway",
      "en_US": [
        "Technology just blows me away!\r",
        "I mean, now you can play with people\n",
        "around the world...wirelessly!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_MapSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Twinleaf Town\n",
        "Fresh and Free!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_PlayerMailbox",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s House"
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_RivalMailbox",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s House"
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_OldManFollowUp",
      "en_US": "Heh... seeing young Trainers stirs\nold memories. Where was it again...?"
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_JourneyRuby",
      "en_US": "Hoenn, red earth"
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_JourneySapphire",
      "en_US": "Hoenn, blue sea"
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_JourneyEmerald",
      "en_US": "Hoenn, green sky"
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_JourneyFireRed",
      "en_US": "Kanto, red flame"
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_JourneyLeafGreen",
      "en_US": "Kanto, green leaf"
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_JourneySinnoh",
      "en_US": "Sinnoh, familiar soil"
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_ResponseRuby",
      "en_US": "That’s right. Hoenn. A land of warm\nearth and rugged paths. I can still\rfeel the heat rising off the ground\nthere."
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_ResponseSapphire",
      "en_US": "That’s right. Hoenn. The sea seemed\nendless there... blue water stretching\rfarther than the eye could see."
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_ResponseEmerald",
      "en_US": "That’s right. Hoenn. Green all around,\nand a sky so vast it felt like the\rwhole world was open to me."
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_ResponseFireRed",
      "en_US": "Of course. Kanto. A lively place. I\nmet all sorts of Trainers there, full\rof spirit and ambition."
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_ResponseLeafGreen",
      "en_US": "Of course. Kanto. Such a refreshing\nplace... quiet routes, tall grass, and\rthat feeling that adventure was\nwaiting just ahead."
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_ResponseSinnoh",
      "en_US": "Sinnoh... Of course. What am I saying?\nI didn’t need to travel far at all.\rMy true adventure was right here\nat home."
    }
  ]
}
